E004 implementation complete: 73/75 tasks [X], 2 withdrawn with recorded evidence
(T004 — HINT-002's premise does not hold; T031 — ADR-0013 gives E003 the runner).

Local gate green on the merged tree (main 79f4f68 merged in):
  401 gateway tests (5 skipped: the opt-in-gated provider smoke check)
  211 root cross-entry checks
  1141 model tests
  7 import contracts kept, 0 broken (gateway 4); mypy strict clean over src
